OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner sentenced over woman's
OL,4,Amorphine death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 83-year-old man has been spared jail
OL,7,Fafter giving morphine to a woman which
OL,8,Fresulted in her death.
OL,10,FLily Gomes, 27, from Hatfield,
OL,11,FHertfordshire died in hospital from
OL,12,Fmorphine toxicity on 18 February 2025,
OL,13,Fafter she was offered the drug by
OL,14,FJeffrey Sutton, also known as Arthur.
OL,16,FShe had fallen unconscious at his home
OL,17,Fin Cotswolds in the town four days
OL,18,Fafter he had offered her the drug.
OL,20,FSutton was sentenced on Friday at St
OL,21,FAlbans Crown Court to 26 months'
OL,22,Fimprisonment, suspended for two years.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
